WEBVTT

00:20:57.995 --> 00:21:03.494
CA: But the challenge with the view that
the neighborhood is the unit of change,

00:21:03.518 --> 00:21:05.310
it's hard to know what to do with it.

00:21:05.334 --> 00:21:08.068
I mean, a neighborhood
is a really complex thing.

00:21:08.092 --> 00:21:11.390
It depends on the local architecture.

00:21:11.414 --> 00:21:13.196
It depends on the local demographics.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:17.120
It depends on whether there are
church services and others going on.

00:21:17.144 --> 00:21:18.988
It depends on education.

00:21:19.012 --> 00:21:21.361
It depends on so many different things.

00:21:21.385 --> 00:21:26.980
And so it's just very, very hard
for someone to say, "This is the fix."

00:21:27.004 --> 00:21:31.668
From that viewpoint, what does it mean
to try to make life better?